\ Deadline: the pictures of the bedroom wing: the short hall north of the
\ stairs and the guest room off it, the hall south of the stairs with its end
\ and linen closet, Ms. Dunbar's bedroom and bathroom, George's bedroom and
\ bathroom. Loaded after scenes.telic; each picture registers itself in
\ room-pictures at the end.

\ === pieces of the bedroom wing ===

\ a point moved along a direction by an amount
: offset-point ( point direction amount -- point' )
	| point direction amount |
	[ 0 3 1 do axis point axis @i direction axis @i amount * + loop ] ;

\ the point at fractions across and up a four-sided surface, its corners in order from the lower left
: quad-point ( quad across up -- point )
	| quad across up |
	quad 0 @i quad 1 @i across between quad 3 @i quad 2 @i across between up between ;

\ the part of a four-sided surface between fractions across and up
: quad-part ( quad left right bottom top -- quad' )
	| quad left right bottom top |
	[ quad left bottom quad-point quad right bottom quad-point
	  quad right top quad-point quad left top quad-point ] ;

\ a window in a wall, its corners from the lower left, divided into columns by rows of panes
: wall-window ( a b c d columns rows -- )
	| a b c d columns rows |
	[ a b c d ] outline
	1 columns 1 do k
		a b k columns / between d c k columns / between segment
	loop
	1 rows 1 do k
		a d k rows / between b c k rows / between segment
	loop ;

\ the slats of a venetian blind drawn down across a window, its corners from the lower left, down to a fraction of its height
: window-slats ( a b c d count lowered -- )
	| a b c d count lowered |
	0 count 1 do k
		1 k 0.5 + count / lowered * - to height
		k 2 mod 0 = if 0.5 else 0.3 then pen!
		a d height between b c height between segment
	loop ;

\ where light passing through a point in a direction reaches the floor
: floor-hit ( point direction -- point' )
	| point direction |
	point direction point 1 @i direction 1 @i negate / offset-point ;

\ the light a window, its corners from the lower left, lets fall on the floor in a direction: a patch ruled faintly along the light
: window-light ( a b c d direction light -- )
	| a b c d direction light |
	[ a b c d ] ( corner | corner direction floor-hit ) map to patch
	patch light fill
	light 1.8 * pen!
	patch 0 @i patch 1 @i patch 2 @i patch 3 @i 6 hatch ;

\ the light a window with its blind down lets fall on the floor: stripes across the light, one for each gap between slats
: window-blind-light ( a b c d direction count light -- )
	| a b c d direction count light |
	[ a b c d ] ( corner | corner direction floor-hit ) map to patch
	patch 0 @i patch 3 @i patch 2 @i patch 1 @i count light blind-light ;

\ a door in a wall between floor points, hinge side first, a height high: shut in its frame with panels and a knob, or swung open toward a direction into the room
: wall-door ( hinge latch height into open? -- )
	| hinge latch height into open? |
	[ 0 1 0 ] to upward
	latch hinge vector- to across
	across across dot sqrt to width
	across unit-vector to along
	[ hinge latch latch upward height offset-point hinge upward height offset-point ] to opening
	opening 0 fill
	open? if
		hinge along width 0.26 * offset-point into width 0.97 * offset-point to swung
		[ hinge swung swung upward height offset-point hinge upward height offset-point ] to leaf
	else
		opening to leaf
	then
	leaf 0 fill
	0.45 pen!
	leaf outline
	0.28 pen!
	leaf 0.15 0.85 0.55 0.9 quad-part outline
	leaf 0.15 0.85 0.1 0.45 quad-part outline
	leaf 0.88 0.46 quad-point to knob
	knob leaf 1 @i leaf 0 @i vector- unit-vector upward 0.022 detail-scale * 8 circle-points to knob-edge
	knob-edge 0.3 fill
	0.9 pen!
	knob-edge outline
	0.6 pen!
	[ hinge hinge upward height offset-point latch upward height offset-point latch ] path ;

\ floorboards running from one side of a floor to the other, a number of them
: floorboards ( a b c d count -- )
	| a b c d count |
	0.07 pen!
	a b c d count hatch ;

\ a bed with its head against a wall: frame, mattress, pillow and the turned-down cover, between two corners on the floor, the head at the first corner's end
: bed-frame ( x0 z0 x1 z1 head-at-north? -- )
	| x0 z0 x1 z1 head-at-north? |
	head-at-north? if z1 else z0 then to head-z
	head-at-north? if 0.05 else -0.05 then to thickness
	[ x0 x1 + 2 / 0.5 head-z ] [ view@x view@y view@z ] vector- dup dot to head-distance
	[ x0 x1 + 2 / 0.5 z0 z1 + 2 / ] [ view@x view@y view@z ] vector- dup dot to bed-distance
	head-distance bed-distance > if
		0.55 pen!
		x0 0 head-z x1 1.05 head-z thickness + solid-box
	then
	0.5 pen!
	x0 0 z0 x1 0.3 z1 solid-box
	0.6 pen!
	x0 0.3 z0 x1 0.52 z1 solid-box
	head-at-north? if z1 0.55 - else z0 0.55 + then to fold
	head-at-north? if z1 0.1 - to head-end z1 0.45 - to pillow-end else z0 0.1 + to head-end z0 0.45 + to pillow-end then
	0.45 pen!
	x0 0.52 fold x1 0.52 fold edge
	0.3 pen!
	x0 0.3 fold 0.12 + x1 0.3 fold 0.12 + edge
	0.8 pen!
	x0 0.1 + 0.52 head-end x1 0.1 - 0.62 pillow-end solid-box
	head-distance bed-distance > not if
		0.55 pen!
		x0 0 head-z x1 1.05 head-z thickness + solid-box
	then ;

\ an end table: a small cabinet with a drawer, a lamp on it if wanted
: end-table-at ( x z lamp? -- )
	| x z lamp? |
	0.5 pen!
	x 0.2 - 0 z 0.2 - x 0.2 + 0.58 z 0.2 + solid-box
	0.35 pen!
	x 0.17 - 0.46 z 0.2 + x 0.17 + 0.46 z 0.2 + edge
	x 0.17 - 0.46 z 0.2 - x 0.17 + 0.46 z 0.2 - edge
	lamp? if
		0.6 pen!
		x 0.58 z 0.02 8 ring outline
		x 0.58 z x 0.84 z edge
		x 0.84 z 0.07 10 ring to lower-rim
		x 1.0 z 0.12 10 ring to upper-rim
		0 10 1 do k lower-rim k @i upper-rim k @i segment loop
		0.85 pen!
		lower-rim outline
		upper-rim outline
		[ x 0.95 z ] 0.35 0.25 glow
	then ;

\ a plain chair facing a heading
: plain-chair ( x z heading -- )
	| x z heading |
	[ heading sin 0 heading cos ] to ahead
	[ heading cos 0 heading sin negate ] to aside
	[ x 0 z ] to centre
	0.5 pen!
	[ [ -1 -1 ] [ 1 -1 ] [ 1 1 ] [ -1 1 ] ] ( corner |
		corner spread to back to side
		centre aside side 0.2 * offset-point ahead back 0.2 * offset-point to foot
		foot foot [ 0 0.45 0 ] ' + 2 nmap segment
	) each
	[ [ -1 -1 ] [ 1 -1 ] [ 1 1 ] [ -1 1 ] ] ( corner |
		corner spread to back to side
		centre aside side 0.21 * offset-point ahead back 0.21 * offset-point [ 0 0.45 0 ] ' + 2 nmap
	) map to seat
	seat 0 fill
	0.6 pen!
	seat outline
	seat 0 @i to back-left
	seat 1 @i to back-right
	[ back-left back-right back-right [ 0 0.5 0 ] ' + 2 nmap back-left [ 0 0.5 0 ] ' + 2 nmap ] to chair-back
	chair-back 0 fill
	chair-back outline ;

\ a ceiling lamp hanging on a cord, its light pooled around it
: hanging-lamp ( x y z ceiling -- )
	| x y z ceiling |
	[ x y z ] 0.9 0.3 glow
	0.4 pen!
	x ceiling z x y 0.12 + z edge
	x y 0.12 + z 0.04 8 ring to top-rim
	x y z 0.2 12 ring to bottom-rim
	0.7 pen!
	0 8 1 do k top-rim k @i bottom-rim k 3 * 2 / round @i segment loop
	0.95 pen!
	bottom-rim outline ;

\ a bare bulb hanging on its cord
: bare-bulb ( x y z ceiling -- )
	| x y z ceiling |
	[ x y z ] 0.7 0.45 glow
	0.4 pen!
	x ceiling z x y 0.05 + z edge
	1 pen!
	x y z 0.035 8 ring outline
	x y 0.03 + z 0.025 8 ring outline ;

\ a wall lamp, its shade against the wall, its light pooled around it
: wall-sconce ( point -- )
	| point |
	point 0.6 0.3 glow
	0.85 pen!
	point spread to z to y to x
	x y 0.08 - z 0.05 8 ring outline
	x y 0.08 + z 0.09 8 ring outline ;

\ === Ms. Dunbar's body, and what lies beside it ===

\ a pistol lying on its side on the floor, its muzzle toward a heading, a thread of smoke rising from it
: floor-pistol ( x z heading -- )
	| x z heading |
	[ heading sin 0 heading cos ] to ahead
	[ heading cos 0 heading sin negate ] to aside
	[ x 0.012 z ] to base
	[ [ 0.14 0 ] [ 0.14 0.025 ] [ -0.03 0.025 ] [ -0.055 0.1 ] [ -0.1 0.1 ] [ -0.07 0 ] ]
	( corner | corner spread to side to along
		base ahead along detail-scale * offset-point aside side detail-scale * offset-point
	) map to outline-points
	outline-points 0.04 fill
	0.95 pen!
	outline-points outline
	base ahead 0.0 offset-point aside 0.035 detail-scale * offset-point to guard
	0.6 pen!
	guard ahead aside 0.018 detail-scale * 8 circle-points outline
	base ahead 0.14 detail-scale * offset-point aside 0.012 detail-scale * offset-point to muzzle
	0.2 pen!
	[ 0 9 1 do k
		k 8 / to rise
		muzzle [ rise 1.6 * sin 0.03 * rise 0.35 * rise 2.1 * cos 0.02 * ] ' + 2 nmap
	loop ] path ;

\ the note beside the body: a pale sheet with lines of shaky writing
: floor-note ( x z heading -- )
	| x z heading |
	[ heading sin 0 heading cos ] to ahead
	[ heading cos 0 heading sin negate ] to aside
	[ x 0.006 z ] to centre
	[ [ -1 -1 ] [ 1 -1 ] [ 1 1 ] [ -1 1 ] ] ( corner | corner spread to side to along
		centre ahead along 0.075 * detail-scale * offset-point aside side 0.055 * detail-scale * offset-point
	) map to sheet
	sheet 0.35 fill
	0.9 pen!
	sheet outline
	[ 0.55 0.4 0.25 ] ( row |
		sheet 0.15 0.85 row row 0.06 + quad-part 0.12 fill
	) each ;

\ a dark pool of blood on the floor, glinting at its edge
: blood-pool ( x z radius -- )
	| x z radius |
	[ 0 12 1 do k
		k 12 / TAU * to angle
		k x 71 * + z 13 * + hash-fraction 0.5 * 0.75 + radius * to reach
		[ x angle cos reach * + 0.004 z angle sin reach * + ]
	loop ] to pool
	pool 0 fill
	0.28 pen!
	pool outline ;

