\ === Ms. Dunbar's Bedroom ===

\ Ms. Dunbar's bedroom: the bed and its tables, a chair, a dressing table with its mirror, the blind half down across the south window laying stripes of light on the floor; after the shot, her body sprawled in them beside the gun and the note
: dunbar-room-picture ( -- )
