\ === George's Bedroom ===

\ the sound of music drawn as arcs spreading from a speaker's face toward the room
: music-arcs ( x y z -- )
	| x y z |
	[ 1 2 3 ] ( ring |
		ring 0.12 * to radius
		0.35 ring 0.08 * - pen!
		[ 0 7 1 do k
			k 6 / PI * PI 2 / - 0.9 * to angle
			[ x angle sin radius * + y angle cos radius * + z radius 0.8 * + ]
		loop ] path
	) each ;

